  "job_B21.5.10_20251003_114556": {
    "chunk_text": "Wi\u00f0 yflum & miclum footsuilun. Cnua beolonan moran sui\u00f0e, lege on \u00f0a foet. Hie ge\u00f0uina\u00f0 & alne \u00f0one ece wunderlice afirra\u00f0. Eft to \u00f0on ilcan. Genim \u00f0\u00e6re l\u00e6ssan mucgwyrte moran, cnua wel, gem\u00e6ng su\u00e6 calde wi\u00f0 hunig, ete \u00f0\u00e6t gemong on \u00d0\u00e6s ilcan lecedom m\u00e6g wi\u00f0 \u00f0eh w\u00e6rce. Gif foet o\u00f0\u00f0o sconcan o\u00f0\u00f0o cnio suellen, genim neodowarde beolonan o\u00f0\u00f0o eolectran, gecnua sui\u00f0e wi\u00f0 Cl\u00e6n on \u00f0\u00ebt asuoln limm, wri\u00f0 on n\u00e6hterne. On m\u00e6rne bi\u00f0 se suile ge\u00f0uinen sio du\u00e6ning d\u00e6g \u00f0aeh \u00f0e hio on neate sie. Wyrc god dust to rotigendum dolge, nim acrinde & slah\u00f0ornes wyrtruman rinde. Innewarde adryg wyrt to duste. \u00d0\u00e6t bi\u00f0 god In dolg to sc\u00e6denne. \u00d0is dust is good to scedenne gif men foet suellen & \u00f0a tan cinen. Ne w\u00e6t \u00f0a \u00f0u foet, & hie sie stille \u00f0endon \u00f0u hine lecnige. Wi\u00f0 foetadle, wyrc scoas of seles felle, do on \u00f0a foet & hi\u00e6 bia\u00f0 sona soel. To \u00f0on ilcan. Wi\u00f0 lend w\u00e6rce, wyrc gyrdels of seles felle, gyrd mi\u00f0 & he bi\u00f0 hal. Wi\u00f0 \u00f0eh \u00e6ci, wyrc drenc, nim eofordrotan walwyrt. Do in win o\u00f0\u00f0o in god waelc alo, drinc on n\u00e6htnistig bollan fulle. Wyrc him aec god b\u00e6\u00f0 eapuldorn, salh",
